        "heading": "What is the best treatment for elbow pain?",
        "body": "If your pain is mild, it is very likely to settle soon if you follow the immediate steps described above. If, however, it does not subside, or it is stronger than mild pain, then physiotherapy is needed to reduce the pain and restore the arm's range of motion and strength. Physiotherapist Konstantinos Danalis applies:"
